Subject: Russia May Have New Mini-Bomb
Message-ID: <Xred-mercuryURe21_4AD@clarinet.com>
From: clarinews@clarinet.com (AP)
Date: Wed, 13 Apr 94 7:20:19 PDT
Keywords: Europe
